{"4551090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Unwoven", "steam_appid": 4551090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwoven</strong> is an isometric action twin-stick shooter where you battle hordes of cursed enemies. Defeat a variety of creatures, absorb their energy, unlock new powers, and explore a mansion filled with secrets as you uncover the story of Laima, her family, and the curse that haunts them, all brought to life through a visual style that blends Gothic Victorian aesthetics with Tim Burton-inspired art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear each room, the dynamic difficulty system, <strong>Fortune</strong>, adapts the challenge to your skill level. Traverse the <strong>Tapestry of Destiny</strong>, a magical loom that represents the mansion's interconnected rooms, and face an experience that evolves alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/56d535667911c3a43cfd9d9778768fb5.avif?t=1783688620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras_big/56d535667911c3a43cfd9d9778768fb5.webp?t=1783688620 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/5785ca131396c4e555654487450f5551.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1517 height=166 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Unwoven, the action never stops. This single-player twin-stick shooter combines frenetic combat, dynamic difficulty, and an atmospheric narrative set in a gothic universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face waves of diverse enemies in ever-changing environments where every playthrough offers a different intensity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/f3110cdf4efd1767f7102608e161cf5b.avif?t=1783688620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras_big/f3110cdf4efd1767f7102608e161cf5b.webp?t=1783688620 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/5953cf60e8088a40ac7375cd6a3983f0.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1517 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fortune system redefines the experience: the game analyzes your performance and adjusts the difficulty in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you mastered the curse? It will become more hostile toward your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to progress? You’ll find opportunities… but at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every strategy, and every victory shapes your path on the tapestry of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/d98f248c7a94d373b650036bb8531476.avif?t=1783688620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras_big/d98f248c7a94d373b650036bb8531476.webp?t=1783688620 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/8339f5d5fe9f2e0848464e2654e07216.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1517 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gothic aesthetic: a contrast between the macabre and the enchanting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A universe woven with mystery, symbolism, and a narrative that unfolds as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwoven</strong> is an isometric action twin-stick shooter where you battle hordes of cursed enemies. Defeat a variety of creatures, absorb their energy, unlock new powers, and explore a mansion filled with secrets as you uncover the story of Laima, her family, and the curse that haunts them, all brought to life through a visual style that blends Gothic Victorian aesthetics with Tim Burton-inspired art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clear each room, the dynamic difficulty system, <strong>Fortune</strong>, adapts the challenge to your skill level. T