tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/5953cf60e8088a40ac7375cd6a3983f0.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1517 height=107 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fortune system redefines the experience: the game analyzes your performance and adjusts the difficulty in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you mastered the curse? It will become more hostile toward your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Struggling to progress? You’ll find opportunities… but at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every strategy, and every victory shapes your path on the tapestry of fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/d98f248c7a94d373b650036bb8531476.avif?t=1783688620\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras_big/d98f248c7a94d373b650036bb8531476.webp?t=1783688620 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/cc9ac783c0b2f0a5499b4f2a784d0bae.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1350 height=210 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4551090/extras/8339f5d5fe9f2e0848464e2654e07216.avif?t=1783688620\" width=1517 height=166 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a gothic aesthetic: a contrast between the macabre and the enchanting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap